string.text:
{=str_tor_religion_description_cult_of_ulric}The Ulrican cult, Church of Ulric or simply the Cult of Ulric is the state approved religious organisation that administrates the worship of the god of war, winter, and wolves. It is second in power and influence to the Cult of Sigmar, but is amongst the most ancient religions of the Empire of Man and dates back before the Empire was created by Sigmar. As a god of war, it is through battle and bloodshed that Ulric is worshipped, any who dare oppose him are merely awaiting the ferocious bite of his priests. {newline}
  {newline}
  Ulric give me the fangs of the wolf,   {newline}
  Ulric give me the claws of the wolf,   {newline}
  Ulric give me the coat of the wolf,   {newline}
  And I will show your enemies the mercy of the wolf.

{=str_tor_religion_description_cult_of_manaan}The religious organisation that oversees and administrates the worship of the god of the sea, oceans, and tides across the Old World. It is most prevalent along the western border of the Empire where the waters of the Sea of Claws touch the shores of man, and most influential within Marienburg. Its members are often navigators, pilots and able-bodied sailors and it is seen as immense luck to have a priest of Manann aboard your vessel.   {newline}
  {newline}
  Manann be praised, for he is the breeze to take us out, {newline}
  Manann be praised, for he is the wave to bring us home, {newline}
  Manann be praised, for he is the food to feed us,{newline}
  Manann be praised, or his be the wrath that drowns us.

{=str_tor_career_switch_explanation_MinorVampire}
  Accept and you shall become a Von Carstein Vampire. This decision is permanent and cannot be reversed.{newline}
  {newline}
  By becoming a Vampire, you will be stripped of your original Lore of Magic as well as the Faith skill.{newline}
  Instead you shall gain unholy powers of the undead…{newline}
  {newline}
  The choice can be accessed later, should you decline now.

{=str_tor_career_switch_explanation_BloodKnight}
  Accept and you shall become a Blood Dragon Vampire. This decision is permanent and cannot be reversed.{newline}
  {newline}
  By becoming a Blood Dragon Vampire, you will be completly stripped of your Spellcraft and Faith skills, and will lose access to magic spells.{newline}
  {newline}
  Instead you shall gain ferocious martial powers of the Ordo Draconis…{newline}
  {newline}
  The choice can be accessed later, should you decline now.

{=str_tor_career_switch_explanation_BlackGrailKnight}
  Accept and you shall enter the ranks of Mousillon Knights. This decision is permanent and cannot be reversed.{newline}
  {newline}
  By becoming a Knight of Mousillon, you will be stripped of your Faith skill. {newline}
  {newline}
  The choice can be accessed later, should you decline now.

{=str_tor_career_switch_explanation_Necrarch}
  Accept and you shall become a Necrach Vampire. This decision is permanent and cannot be reversed.{newline}
  {newline}
  By becoming a Necrach Vampire, you shall be stripped of Life Magic or Light magic, if you possess it, as well as the Faith skill.{newline}
  Instead you shall gain arcane powers of the Necrarch bloodline…{newline}
  {newline}
  The choice can be accessed later, should you decline now.
